request.description:
Crea una partida pública (matchmaking automático).

**Response 200 (en cola):**
```json
{
  "outcome": "added_to_queue"
}
```

**Response 201 (match encontrado):**
```json
{
  "id": "match-uuid",
  "matchType": "public",
  "status": "pending",
  "player1": {
    "userId": "uuid",
    "username": "player1",
    "score": 0
  },
  "player2": {
    "userId": "uuid",
    "username": "player2",
    "score": 0
  },
  "createdAt": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z"
}
```

**⚠️ NOTA:** Postman no maneja WebSockets correctamente.

**Usar herramientas alternativas:**

**1. wscat (CLI):**
```bash
wscat -c "ws://localhost:3000/api/game/ws?token=YOUR_TOKEN&matchId=MATCH_ID"
```

**2. Browser Console:**
```javascript
const ws = new WebSocket(
  'ws://localhost:3000/api/game/ws?token=YOUR_TOKEN&matchId=MATCH_ID'
);

ws.onopen = () => console.log('✅ Connected');
ws.onmessage = (msg) => console.log('📥', JSON.parse(msg.data));

// Enviar movimientos
ws.send(JSON.stringify({ action: 'MOVE_UP' }));
ws.send(JSON.stringify({ action: 'MOVE_DOWN' }));
```

**Mensajes del servidor:**
```json
{
  "event": "JOINED_MATCH",
  "data": {
    "matchId": "uuid",
    "playerId": "your-uuid",
    "status": "pending",
    "message": "Bienvenido..."
  }
}
```

**Mensajes al servidor:**
```json
{ "action": "MOVE_UP" }
{ "action": "MOVE_DOWN" }
```
